---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Ghulam Abbas about IT, security or career questions.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p>
        Have a question, a topic you'd like me to write about, or a collaboration idea? I read every message, though I
        can't promise a reply to all of them.
      </p>
      <div class="grid" style="margin: 24px 0">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Email</h3>
          <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>LinkedIn</h3>
          <p><a href={SITE.linkedin} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">linkedin.com/in/abbasravian</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Leadership roles and professional networking</h2>
      <p>
        For senior IT roles, speaking or professional introductions, the best route is
        <a href={SITE.linkedin} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>, where you can see my full background.
      </p>

      <h2>Advisory, training or mentoring enquiries</h2>
      <p>To help me reply usefully, include in your first message:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The organisation or team, and roughly how large it is.</li>
        <li>The problem you want solved, and why it matters now.</li>
        <li>Your timeline, and whether this is advice, a review, training or mentoring.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted small">
        Please don't send passwords or sensitive company data. I can't give hands-on support for individual systems
        by email, but I'm happy to point you in the right direction.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
